      "writtenOn": "2020-04-03T16:33:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "stubsSymbolFile has to be OptionalPath for the non-stub cases. Handling a nil Symbol_file here is indeed unnecessary, but using OptionalPathForModuleSrc is more convenient since it both takes and returns what I want, and as you point out it\u0027ll fail anyway below if it\u0027s missing.\n\n\u003e Could you pass this directly into compileStubLibrary()\n\nI considered that, but it means refactoring in a bunch of places not really relevant to this CL.\n\n\u003e or maybe initialize it in there?\n\ncompileStubLibrary doesn\u0027t have access to the library object.",
      "parentUuid": "16acc359_5d039b98",
      "revId": "c5dd4f7c1f3958bb68ad493088275b286a6acd6b",
