      "writtenOn": "2020-04-03T16:33:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I reason that each SDK snapshot should only expose a specific version, so the user instead picks the appropriate snapshot. Having the version axis twice can only lead to confusion. \n\nIdeally we ought to filter the symbol file itself too to only contain one version. Actually, propagating it wholesale like this will probably lead to a problem down the line in that we\u0027ll get meaningless updates in old snapshots as the symbol file is extended for new future versions.",
      "parentUuid": "fec52ffc_f81fba14",
      "revId": "c5dd4f7c1f3958bb68ad493088275b286a6acd6b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
